{"title":"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is chosen at random from the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/1/671a1a7ac91ce2bb91e577810eefc2a315850f25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2,3,\\cdots,99,100\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />, and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is chosen at random from the same set. The probability that the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/f/fcfacc29e1444310a80fd6ad850d2f12211daae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^a+7^b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" /> has units digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/0/fc0e5294f13907fb2c90d9363c32725241e67309.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{1}{16}\\quad \\text{(B) } \\frac{1}{8}\\quad \\text{(C) } \\frac{3}{16}\\quad \\text{(D) } \\frac{1}{5}\\quad \\text{(E) } \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"301\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The units digits of the powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> both cycle through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/a/efaab9498ca721504a6522e6d2b597733e8529f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,3,9,7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" /> in opposite directions, and as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/7/e276eb6f05c95fa9e8a850cf5ceb1705986ee956.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\mid 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> each power's units digit is equally probable. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> ordered pairs of units digits, and three of them <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54a90912805e43254620511f6000ded27ca5ea65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,7),(7,1),(9,9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" /> have a sum with units digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the probability is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/4/d74029a8a03122d1847c40203c8385dc4050b76d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac3{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME\" title=\"1990 AHSME\">1990 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Probl